	"data": "Concept: Focus System\n\nThe Problem\ncithoreal tends to jump between projects when excited. New shiny things pull attention away from things already in flight. This is a known pattern, not a criticism — the system should actively counteract it.\n\nThe Rules\nAlways check PROJECTS.md (or vault/index/projects.md) before starting anything new in a session\nWhen a new project/idea comes up mid-session, capture it to backlog immediately — don't start it\nIncomplete high-priority items stay surfaced in…",
